WEBVTT

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.560
Where are we?

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.650
Interstellar jump a success.

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:30.650
Lady Himiko!

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.510
Azuchi has suffered minimal damage.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.510
I am fine.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.860
Current location confirmed: Yomotsuhirasaka!

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.300
My betrothed!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.660
Amazing. The water is glowing.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.600
My betrothed!

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:56.950
Himiko!

00:00:58.790 --> 00:00:59.820
Himiko!

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.830
Nobunaga!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.130
Himiko!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.130
No good! We can't maintain altitude!

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.670
Brace for impact!

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.330
The Hermit, upright.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:39.070
The blue flames

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.770
signify this is a sacred place,
 where ley lines converge.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.610
You've come to.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:46.110
Don't push yourself.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.790
Azuchi will come for us soon enough.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.890
I see.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.160
Are you cold?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:55.180
I'm sorry.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.570
I'll be warm soon enough.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:00.710
I have used too much power.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.310
My betrothed.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.900
What do you believe
 happened to Mitsuhide and Caesar?

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.230
I don't know.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.520
Aren't you worried?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.950
If worry guaranteed their rescue,

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.660
I'd worry all day.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.130
But they will be fine.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:19.610
I doubt those two will be done in so easily.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.380
Is that so...

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.090
What are those markings?

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.870
Yomotsuhirasaka is the Eastern
 anchor of the Ladder to the Heavens.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.940
It is linked to Donremy Village, 
the Western anchor point.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:40.940
I saw a massive structure within the lake.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.170
It is what activates the
 Ladder to the Heavens.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:46.550
Very few remain who
 know of its existence.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:51.150
Even so, it feels strangely familiar...

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:55.810
You and I have met here in the past.

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.220
She has no visible injuries, 
but she is very weak.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.200
Leave her to me.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.640
I am very familiar
 with human physiology.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.840
If my diagnosis is correct,

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:16.240
Lady Himiko's weakness has
 something to do with the ley lines.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.110
Excuse me.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.640
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.100
That's right.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.790
I must ask the men to leave this room.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.890
You're a man, too!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.730
I am a painter.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:31.630
I am quite familiar
 with the female nude.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:32.740
But...!

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:34.220
I'll stay.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.140
Thanks.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.610
Nobu-sama...

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.460
This is...

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.600
There is no need for concern.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.580
She just used a little too
 much of her powers as a priestess.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:23.100
I believe she will
 recover if she rests a while.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:24.460
I see.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.180
I'm sorry.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.290
Don't worry. Take your time resting.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:35.220
I've been meaning to thank you, anyway.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.630
Thank me?

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:40.880
I mean... it's because of
 me that this is all happening.

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.330
How self-centered.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.000
I did it for my betrothed.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.810
Caesar, I've heard

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:54.640
that you finally got your 
hands on an Eastern woman.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:58.980
Only you would be blind enough to do so,
 though they are uncivilized barbarians.

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.550
You are quite the womanizer.

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:05.900
I would love to describe the
 softness of my Eastern woman's skin

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.890
for a thousand and one nights.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:11.030
You worthless worm.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.390
Caesar, that's enough!

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.860
Who do we have here?

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.020
An Easterner, I see.

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:20.060
Your unrefined face is most telling.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.200
You must come from a
 long line of country folk.

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.030
Your father must also stink of the country—

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:26.850
Silence!

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:29.220
You bastard!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:45.740
You're better off being the 
material for a homunculus.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.890
Ichihime-sama...

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:20.300
She must be worried
 about Mitsuhide-sama.

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:23.310
Hey, take a look at this!

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.580
Western clothing? What about it?

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.460
It's what ladies-in-waiting wear.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.640
I was told it's customary 
on the Star of the West.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:38.380
I didn't know your
 father was your weakness.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:40.240
Caesar!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.860
There, that's exactly what I mean.

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.840
You lose control of your emotions

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:46.920
and lose yourself in anger,
 Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.740
That is your true nature.

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:50.130
What's your point?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.770
I was just curious

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:57.030
why someone as sharp-witted as
 yourself would work for Nobunaga.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.170
Now I know from what I just saw.

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:03.810
All of your actions have
 something to do with your father.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.630
Don't talk about such things.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.780
It's empty speculation.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:10.210
But it's probably the truth.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:22.830
Whatever your reasons,

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.210
Nobunaga's ambition is 
simply a means for you

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:29.540
to shake off the
 shadow cast by your father.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.430
Don't be ridiculous.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.560
Unable to wield any Regalia,

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:37.840
you are not fit to seek dominion.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.840
To be a strategist is all you can hope for.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.900
Azuchi has emerged
 into normal space-time.

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.710
Confirming closure of ley line barriers.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:11.600
Reestablishing link to
 guardian spirit navigation system.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:16.610
Nobunaga.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:18.030
How is Himiko?

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.780
She's much more relaxed now.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:20.920
Let me take over.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.250
I'll keep watch, so go get some rest.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:23.990
But...

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.850
I need to speak with her.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.590
What is it?

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.700
What you mentioned before.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.320
You said we'd met in the past.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.840
You've mentioned it before, too.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.120
What are you talking about?

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.340
Oh, about that.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:44.850
When I was younger,

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:49.580
I was secluded in Yomotsuhirasaka
 for training as a priestess.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.350
That's when we met...

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.090
I'm not scared.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:02.380
I'm not scared. Not scared! Not scared!

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:15.970
S-Stay away!

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.060
I'm not scared!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.750
Not scared!

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.010
I'm not scared at all!

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.020
I'm not!

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:46.810
Hey, are you okay?

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:56.010
I've been told that normal human 
beings cannot pass the outer barrier.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.350
Who are you?

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:00.970
My boat went adrift, and I ended up here.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.320
Where is this place?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.350
Yomotsuhirasaka.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:07.000
It's a sacred place.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.260
Sacred place?

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.100
It's where life meets death

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:13.000
and the ley lines converge.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:17.320
It has been the custom of Yamatai's royal
 priestesses to seclude themselves here

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.650
and train alone for generations.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.640
Oh.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.760
So you're a princess.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:24.450
What do you do when you train?

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:27.060
I fight monsters.

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:28.110
Monsters?!

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.280
Where are the monsters?!

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:31.850
You can't see them.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.020
What?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.360
They are in your soul.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:37.260
Your soul creates the monsters.

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.920
What are you talking about?

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.280
Now laugh!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.310
For I just killed the monsters.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:58.040
What?

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:01.980
Besides, you're only scared because
 you look like you're about to cry.

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.490
Laugh and blow all of it off!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.020
Oh, where are you going?

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:12.030
Later!

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.710
Good luck with your training!

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:14.920
I'll be going now.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.140
You!

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.390
Where are you from? Who are you?

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.390
Me?

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:21.460
Hmm...

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.200
I'm just someone who's lost!

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.980
It was only after my training was concluded

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:49.760
that I learned you were Oda's scion,
 widely known as The Fool.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.620
That happened?

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:57.220
The barriers protecting Yomotsuhirasaka 
tampered with your memories.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:00.300
But the fact that you were
 allowed entry into a sacred land where

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:03.770
no mere mortal may enter
 shows that the ley lines accepted you.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.700
You chose to become my bride
 because the ley lines accepted me?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.410
Don't be ridiculous!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.050
I j-just fell in love 
with you at first sight!

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:18.050
I'm suddenly feeling feverish.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.160
The Pillars of Hercules has opened.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.390
We must make haste.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.940
The time has come for you to act.

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:43.090
I have long waited to hear those words.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:46.310
I will go to the East this very instant.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.950
Your words hearten me,

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.450
my best general.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:53.590
Your gaze can pierce through stone,

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:56.760
and your breath can
 set even arctic ice ablaze.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.370
I do not deserve such honor.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:03.110
I must do your loyalty justice, as well.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:06.360
King Arthur...

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.220
Like the great Achilles,

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.650
my liege King Arthur,
 peerless and absolute!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:27.290
I charge you, in the name 
of the Savior-King, with this:

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.360
go forth, and wreak havoc!

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:30.960
Your Majesty!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.320
Even though your family has 
borne the name of Kaguya,

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.800
I'm surprised you didn't know.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:45.010
You really don't know anything.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.480
What should I know?

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.110
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:52.830
"Kaguya" is a word that stems 
from the Ladder to the Heavens.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:54.380
Don't you understand?

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:58.570
From the very moment you
 were born in Donremy Village,

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.430
you were already linked 
to the Star of the East.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:02.390
That's...

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.320
What a pity.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:07.170
To think that such an
 ignorant woman is my rival in love.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.790
No, you shouldn't get up yet.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:11.370
Himiko!

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.340
I hate it!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.970
I hate how you pretend
 not to notice how you feel

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:24.070
and stay by my betrothed's side
 as though there's nothing going on.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:25.270
I can't stand it!

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.230
What?!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.750
I'm just trying to better
 understand the Savior-King.

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:31.850
You're a girl! Be honest!

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:35.420
How much longer do you
 intend to keep lying to yourself?

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:38.300
On my honor as the Queen of Yamatai...

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:41.140
No, as a woman!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.370
I <i>will</i> win my betrothed's heart!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:45.870
This is a declaration of war.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:48.570
You have an obligation to accept.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.110
So you're serious...

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.660
Jokes are not my cup of tea.

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:59.420
I have loved my betrothed since 
one entire celestial cycle ago.

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:00.720
From that long ago...

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.470
Are you surprised?

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.570
You have no chance of winning.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.110
I won't be defeated.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:07.920
What?

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.620
I love him, too.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:13.270
I will never, ever let you win!

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.100
Oh?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.120
How are you doing?

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.160
What's going on?

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.110
Prepare yourself, Fool-dono.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.110
Yes.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.310
The war has begun!

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:31.830
What?

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.020
Who knows?

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.690
Cesare is an extremely nasty man.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:43.530
You will be given a most agonizing end.

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:44.790
You can look forward to it.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.940
What do you people call it?
 The "death poem"?

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:52.800
I heard that warlords of the East 
write poetry to prepare for death.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.470
I can take yours to Ichihime,
 if you'd like.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.510
You bastard!

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.710
Take a look in the mirror.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:03.140
You have not managed to confess
 your feelings to the one you care for.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.880
Look how ugly and
 twisted with hate your face is.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:06.720
Shut up!

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:09.070
You hide your face beneath a mask!

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.190
You have no right.

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:15.780
Don't you think an invisible mask 
that hides how you really feel

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.890
is far worse than a mask all can see?

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:23.760
Once, I was wounded in a 
duel fought over a certain lady.

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:27.960
I thought I'd wear this
 mask until the wound healed,

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:31.870
but strangely enough,
 it was popular with the ladies.

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:38.150
I wonder if they found it 
alluring that I hid my face.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:42.750
Ever since, the mask
 has become my second face.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.140
It appears we've reached our destination.

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.760
General Caesar, this way, please.

00:18:58.180 --> 00:19:00.420
Ichihime does not suit you.

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.540
What?!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:06.400
She is far nobler and wiser than you.

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:09.060
You can't even wield a single Regalia.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:10.750
You cannot hope to be worthy of her.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:15.740
I am the only one who 
can bring her happiness.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:16.620
That's ridiculous!

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:20.020
Are you going to let this be your end?

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:23.730
Farewell, then, Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:24.560
Caesar!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.740
Why?

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:36.300
Why am I not worthy?

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.080
This is...

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.450
Is it a trap? Or...

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:56.160
Nobu'd just say,
 "It was inevitable," I suppose.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.160
Go, go!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:07.170
Good luck!
 Even if you can't use a Regalia!

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:12.080
Loyal servants of the great King Arthur,

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:17.010
the time has finally come to give your 
lives for the Savior-King's ideals!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:20.420
Let us make manifest a sacred world...

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:23.350
...and attain perfect harmony!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.430
Let us make manifest a sacred world

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:28.490
and attain perfect harmony!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:31.510
Let us make manifest a sacred world

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.460
and attain perfect harmony!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.770
All ships, launch!

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:39.430
Let us bring salvation to this vast world!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:51.600
The barbarians from the East will 
open the way to the Holy Grail.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.130
I suppose this, too,
 was fated by the ley lines.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:59.890
We will soon arrive at Owari castle.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.950
Ready the anchors.

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:07.690
Please have a ramp dockside,
 so that we can transport Lady Himiko.

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:10.790
I suspected that you had noticed.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:13.810
I am no physician,

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.910
but I have a measure of confidence 
in my ability to see ley lines.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.510
Well?

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:22.090
How do the ley lines that 
flow within me appear to you?

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:24.540
The flow of energy is faint

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.470
and may halt altogether at any moment.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:30.950
You knew, Lady Himiko?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:35.260
The queens of Yamatai
 have historically been short-lived.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:39.310
It seems I cannot
 hope to escape that fate.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:42.250
I have one request.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.310
You must tell no one.

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:48.200
Above all,
 my betrothed can never learn of this.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.580
I accept.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.850
In return, after I die,

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:55.180
you may have this body.

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:59.610
Feel free to dissect it and
 examine it to your heart's content.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:04.090
You are telling me to dissect you?

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:08.710
I'd like to be the last 
one to suffer this fate.

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:17.590
All men carry within them another 
self no one is allowed to see.

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:20.100
They laugh, concealing their grief,

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:22.270
and shed tears, concealing their mirth.

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:29.610
Then what face does The Hermit conceal 
within this man's heart wear?

00:24:11.670 --> 00:24:14.480
Sometimes, you just can't retreat,

00:24:14.480 --> 00:24:17.490
no matter how big the
 wall that stands in your way!

00:24:18.620 --> 00:24:20.490
Next time: The Emperor.

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:23.790
Nobu-sama is the only emperor for me!
